  "description": "Variation of Condition 1 and alteration to the wording of Conditions 3 and 4 of planning permission dated 24 February 2025 (Ref: 24/07664/FULL) for, 'Demolition of existing roof and erection of a mansard roof extension at first floor level and alterations to the front and rear of the portion of the building fronting onto Bryanston Mews East. Subdivision and reconfiguration of existing ground and lower ground floor levels of the building and together with the new first floor extension to the mews portion of the building, create two self-contained residential units (Class C3) and associated external alterations. Lowering of front pavement vault' [Site includes 22 Bryanston Mews East]; Namely: substitute approved drawings to allow revised rooflight design, negating the requirement to provide detail of the roof light and to allow the external glazing of the rooflight to be clear, with opaque glazing provided to the internal face. (Application under Section 73)",
